        "body": "Lay the tomato slices on towels, sprinkle with 1 tsp salt, and wait 10 minutes, then pat them very dry. Meanwhile toss the cabbage, scallions, vinegar, sugar, and 1/2 tsp salt. Beat the eggs with the water. Stir the remaining salt and the pepper into the cornmeal. About 18 minutes.",
