        "title": "Heat the beans",
        "body": "Warm the olive oil and garlic in a saucepan over medium for 1 minute. Add the beans, smoked paprika, and a splash of water if they look dry. Heat through, about 8 minutes, while the tomatoes cook. Keep them warm.",
